{{!-- A page's own hashtag under its title (event, club, player). Receives an
      EntityHashtag: the hashtag links to its gallery when media carries it and
      renders as a plain token otherwise, as a trick page's hashtag does. --}}
<p class="hero-hashtag">{{#if galleryHref}}<a href="{{galleryHref}}">{{display}}</a>{{else}}{{display}}{{/if}}</p>
